    "placeholder": "Enter your reflection here.",
    "long_instructions": "> A city’s parks department wants to use a chatbot to answer resident questions about park hours, reservations, and permit fees. A resident asks the chatbot whether the permit application they submitted this morning has been approved yet.\r\n>\r\n> Would you trust the chatbot to answer this without a human reviewing it first? Explain your reasoning, and connect it to something you noticed about the library chatbot today.",
